<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Notas personales</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css"></head><body><header><strong>Notas personales</strong><span>Aplicaciones web · Módulo 3</span></header><main><h1>Mis notas</h1><p>Consulta y edita notas compartidas. Todos los cambios se guardan a través de la API.</p><div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="workspace"><form id="note-form"><h2 id="form-title">Nueva nota</h2><input type="hidden" name="id"><label for="title">Título</label><input id="title" name="title" maxlength="150" required><label for="author">Autor</label><input id="author" name="author" maxlength="100" required><label for="noted_at">Fecha y hora</label><input id="noted_at" name="noted_at" type="datetime-local" required><label for="category_id">Clasificación</label><select id="category_id" name="category_id" required></select><label for="body">Contenido</label><textarea id="body" name="body" required></textarea><button id="save" type="submit">Guardar nota</button><button type="button" id="cancel" class="secondary">Cancelar</button></form><section id="notes" aria-label="Notas guardadas"></section></div></main><footer>Emilio Garza Vargas · Matrícula 2928291 · Datos de demostración · Edición pública en el entorno local</footer><script src="/app.js"></script></body></html>
